    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d463">

                <pb facs="0551" n="447" xml:id="pg447"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1002.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 13, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The agents arrived Thursday and have departed for their posts with detailed
                    instructions. The Department’s delegates arrived yesterday and will remain
                    here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
